ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa158: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE; face orientation flag is .F. (reversed) — ambiguous without closed-shell context; outer wire: 10×10 rectangle at (0,0)-(10,10) with FACE_OUTER_BOUND(.T.); inner hole wire: 3×3 rectangle at (3,3)-(6,6) with FACE_BOUND(.F.); both face flag and inner-bound flag reversed — consistent in closed shell; FixOrientation applied in isolation cannot determine correct orientation; context-free fix is unreliable; kernel must have closed-shell context; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; no orphaned entities */
